---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Fitness Apps with Workout Videos';
const description = 'Fitness apps with workout videos can help users follow proper form, train consistently and build confidence with guided exercise sessions.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Workout Videos</div><h1>Fitness apps with workout videos and guided training.</h1><p class="lead">Workout videos make fitness easier to start because users can see what to do, how to move and how each exercise fits into the broader plan.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="container"><article>

<h2>Why workout videos matter</h2><p>Written exercise plans can be useful, but many people need visual guidance. Video helps users understand setup, tempo, body position and the purpose of each movement.</p><h2>What a strong workout video library should include</h2><ul><li>Strength movements such as squats, deadlifts, rows and presses.</li><li>Beginner-friendly foundation exercises.</li><li>Mobility and body care routines.</li><li>Filters for body part, muscle, level and equipment.</li><li>Short sessions for busy users and longer plans for structured training.</li></ul><h2>SEO angle</h2><p>This page should target users comparing apps with follow-along workout videos, exercise libraries, guided training plans and professional movement instruction.</p><div class="callout"><strong>Content angle:</strong> This page should connect the topic back to the app naturally. Mention guided training, body care, nutrition education and mental performance where relevant without forcing a sales pitch.</div>
</article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
